{"id":"n67388-1-8","stage":5,"title":"뒷바라지 · 照料","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67388-1-8-1","ko":"그동안 아이들 뒷바라지에 고생이 많으셨죠?","zh":"这段时间为了照顾孩子们，您一定很辛苦吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그동안","meaning":"近来，这段时间","explanation":"그동안：近来，这段时间","readings":[{"term":"그동안","audio":"/audio/d33dc138cdc9a561307b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60236","senseId":"1","lemma":"그동안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그동안","audio":"/audio/d33dc138cdc9a561307b.mp3"}},{"text":"아이들","meaning":"孩子","explanation":"아이：孩子；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"2","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이들","audio":"/audio/8451fc733a6420da90ac.mp3"}},{"text":"뒷바라지에","meaning":"照料，伺候，后援","explanation":"뒷바라지：照料，伺候，后援；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"뒷바라지","audio":"/audio/3239b8d83baf63bbf1ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67388","senseId":"1","lemma":"뒷바라지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뒷바라지에","audio":"/audio/27b21fe64a35339473c2.mp3"}},{"text":"고생이","meaning":"辛苦，艰苦，遭罪","explanation":"고생：辛苦，艰苦，遭罪；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"고생","audio":"/audio/7a47595464bf07f8bbab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22629","senseId":"1","lemma":"고생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고생이","audio":"/audio/a860c1f18ce77b6d9175.mp3"}},{"text":"많으셨죠?","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；으시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많으셨죠","audio":"/audio/08e536286926c4ca25e8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d33dc138cdc9a561","term":"그동안","zh":"近来，这段时间","audio":"/audio/d33dc138cdc9a561307b.mp3","entryId":"60236","definition":"前面已经说过的那些时间；或指再次相逢或再次联系之前的一段时间。","pronunciation":["그동안"]},{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"(谦词)自己的子女。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"3239b8d83baf63bb","term":"뒷바라지","zh":"照料，伺候，后援","audio":"/audio/3239b8d83baf63bbf1ba.mp3","entryId":"67388","definition":"在背后照顾帮忙的行为。","pronunciation":["뒤ː빠라지","뒫ː빠라지"]},{"id":"7a47595464bf07f8","term":"고생","zh":"辛苦，艰苦，遭罪","audio":"/audio/7a47595464bf07f8bbab.mp3","entryId":"22629","definition":"经历痛苦艰辛的事情；或指那种生活。","pronunciation":["고생"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/e827b65fceeb1e69ac29.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67388-1-8-2","ko":"네. 새벽에 나가는 아이 밥을 해 먹이는 게 제일 힘들더라고요.","zh":"是啊。最费劲的就是要早起给要出门的孩子做饭。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"새벽에","meaning":"凌晨，早晨","explanation":"새벽：凌晨，早晨；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"새벽","audio":"/audio/d0a36389c6b198a158ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62740","senseId":"2","lemma":"새벽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새벽에","audio":"/audio/0caa7eb4a0f8e3ed42cb.mp3"}},{"text":"나가는","meaning":"去","explanation":"나가다：去；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"8","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나가는","audio":"/audio/82571ba278e3348a09f6.mp3"}},{"text":"아이","meaning":"孩子","explanation":"아이：孩子","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d65